libquo
------------------------------------------
QUO (as in 'status quo') is a runtime library that aids in accommodating
thread-level heterogeneity in dynamic, phased MPI+X applications comprising
single- and multi-threaded libraries.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  liblevel-zero1-1.34.0-1bl1
  libopenmpi40-4.1.6-1
  libquo-devel-1.4.1-1bl1
  libquo8-1.4.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libhwloc-devel-2.13.0-1
  liblevel-zero-devel-1.34.0-1bl1
  libopenmpi-devel-4.1.6-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  openmpi-4.1.6-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/lanl/libquo

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/lanl/libquo/archive/refs/tags/v1.4.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libquo-1.4.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libquo-1.4.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libquo-1.4.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libquo-1.4.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libquo8-1.4.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libquo-devel-1.4.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libquo)
  /usr/bin/quo-info.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libquo.README
  /usr/share/doc/libquo/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libquo/COPYRIGHT
  /usr/share/doc/libquo/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libquo/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/libquo/THANKS
  /usr/share/doc/libquo/TODO

(libquo8)
  /usr/bin/cygquo-8.dll
  /usr/bin/cygquo-usequo-8.dll

(libquo-devel)
  /usr/include/quo.h
  /usr/include/quo.mod
  /usr/lib/libquo-usequo.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libquo.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libquo.pc

